    "items": [
      {
        "type": "heading1",
        "verse_numbers": [],
        "lines": [
          "A Father’s Example"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          1
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Listen, sons, to a father’s discipline,",
          "and pay attention so that you may gain understanding,"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          2
        ],
        "lines": [
          "for I am giving you good instruction.",
          "Don’t abandon my teaching."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          3
        ],
        "lines": [
          "When I was a son with my father,",
          "tender and precious to my mother,"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          4
        ],
        "lines": [
          "he taught me and said,",
          "“Your heart must hold on to my words.",
          "Keep my commands and live."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          5
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Get wisdom, get understanding;",
          "don’t forget or turn away from the words from my mouth."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          6
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Don’t abandon wisdom, and she will watch over you;",
          "love her, and she will guard you."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          7
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Wisdom is supreme #— #so get wisdom.",
          "And whatever else you get, get understanding."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          8
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Cherish her, and she will exalt you;",
          "if you embrace her, she will honor you."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          9
        ],
        "lines": [
          "She will place a garland of favor on your head;",
          "she will give you a crown of beauty.”"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "heading1",
        "verse_numbers": [],
        "lines": [
          "Two Ways of Life"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          10
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Listen, my son. Accept my words,",
          "and you will live many years."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          11
        ],
        "lines": [
          "I am teaching you the way of wisdom;",
          "I am guiding you on straight paths."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          12
        ],
        "lines": [
          "When you walk, your steps will not be hindered;",
          "when you run, you will not stumble."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          13
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Hold on to instruction; don’t let go.",
          "Guard it, for it is your life."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          14
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Keep off the path of the wicked;",
          "don’t proceed on the way of evil ones."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          15
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Avoid it; don’t travel on it.",
          "Turn away from it, and pass it by."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          16
        ],
        "lines": [
          "For they can’t sleep",
          "unless they have done what is evil;",
          "they are robbed of sleep",
          "unless they make someone stumble."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          17
        ],
        "lines": [
          "They eat the bread of wickedness",
          "and drink the wine of violence."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          18
        ],
        "lines": [
          "The path of the righteous is like the light of dawn,",
          "shining brighter and brighter until midday."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          19
        ],
        "lines": [
          "But the way of the wicked is like the darkest gloom;",
          "they don’t know what makes them stumble."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "heading1",
        "verse_numbers": [],
        "lines": [
          "The Straight Path"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          20
        ],
        "lines": [
          "My son, pay attention to my words;",
          "listen closely to my sayings."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          21
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Don’t lose sight of them;",
          "keep them within your heart."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          22
        ],
        "lines": [
          "For they are life to those who find them,",
          "and health to one’s whole body."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          23
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Guard your heart above all else,",
          "for it is the source of life."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          24
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Don’t let your mouth speak dishonestly,",
          "and don’t let your lips talk deviously."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          25
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Let your eyes look forward;",
          "fix your gaze straight ahead."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          26
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Carefully consider the path for your feet,",
          "and all your ways will be established."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          27
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Don’t turn to the right or to the left;",
          "keep your feet away from evil."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      }
    ]
  },
